    m_Localized: Arrow Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709082423296
    m_Localized: Fires an arrow at the nearest enemy. Leveling up adds arrows and
      pierce
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811904
    m_Localized: The arrow pierces without a care
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811905
    m_Localized: Piercing Arrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811906
    m_Localized: A heavier head sinks deeper
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811907
    m_Localized: Heavier Head
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811908
    m_Localized: What lines up dies in a line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811909
    m_Localized: Gone in a Line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811910
    m_Localized: Many shots packed into one
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811911
    m_Localized: All in One Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811912
    m_Localized: One shot skewers the whole row, and a follow-up finds the weak spot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811913
    m_Localized: Shot That Skewers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811914
    m_Localized: More arrows follow, and the string never rests
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811915
    m_Localized: Follow-up Arrows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811916
    m_Localized: Draw the string and the sky goes dark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811917
    m_Localized: Darkening Sky
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811918
    m_Localized: Every shot pours down like rain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811919
    m_Localized: Pouring Arrow Rain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811920
    m_Localized: That rain does not know how to stop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811921
    m_Localized: Rain Without End
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811922
