  - m_Id: 709090811949
    m_Localized: Eye of Ruin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811950
    m_Localized: Orb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811951
    m_Localized: Summons an orb that pierces forward. Deals damage over time to every
      enemy it touches and slows them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811952
    m_Localized: The sky is no safe place
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811953
    m_Localized: No Exception in the Sky
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811954
    m_Localized: The orb grows visibly heavier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811955
    m_Localized: Heavy Orb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811956
    m_Localized: The winged ones regret it most
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811957
    m_Localized: Winged Regret
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811958
    m_Localized: Where it passes turns to swamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811959
    m_Localized: Swamp in Its Wake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811960
    m_Localized: Bigger, more often, bluer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811961
    m_Localized: Big Blue Orb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811962
    m_Localized: The swamp deepens and the hand quickens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811963
    m_Localized: Deepening Swamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811964
    m_Localized: Whatever it touches goes soft
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811965
    m_Localized: Softened Things
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811966
    m_Localized: Instead of one orb, small ones give chase in a pack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811967
    m_Localized: Little Ones in Chase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811968
    m_Localized: The pack swells and everything it grazes goes soft
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811969
    m_Localized: Swollen Pack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
