    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811974
    m_Localized: Lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811975
    m_Localized: For 6 seconds, every enemy that takes attack damage has a 30% chance
      to be struck by lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811976
    m_Localized: The clouds are slow to clear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811977
    m_Localized: Clouds That Linger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811978
    m_Localized: The gathered clouds ride on every blow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811979
    m_Localized: Clouds on Every Blow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811980
    m_Localized: The more it gathers, the less you can handle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811981
    m_Localized: Fiercer as It Gathers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811982
    m_Localized: The storm takes a short breath
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811983
    m_Localized: Short Breath
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811984
    m_Localized: An iron rod is driven into the ground, and the sky aims at nothing
      else
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811985
    m_Localized: Iron Rod in the Ground
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811986
